   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d0f80fa3303510d00ac",
   "sourceHash": "0d0f80fa3303510d00ac2a421388e540d1e3f9c5059cda6e41cf5999d2b9e84a",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]我们的阿育吠陀光泽与皮肤健康项目，展现您肌肤与生俱来的美丽与活力，让您焕发新生。",
